Local modifications: Only the Qt-free core library is included (include/, src/AutoRemesher/,
  thirdparty/isotropicremesher/, thirdparty/meshoptimizer/src/). The GUI, Qt, bundled Eigen and
  TBB are left out; Phantom's own Eigen and TBB are used instead.
  The per-phase timing report is only printed when AUTO_REMESHER_DEBUG is set.
